30.m:
Nārada said:
In the central lotus one should worship Brahmā with his limbs, and in the eastern [lotus] Viṣṇu;
in the south-eastern lotus Prakṛti, and in the southern lotus Puruṣa.

29-r2.m:
Rice powder and the like should be white; safflower and the like, red;
with turmeric, yellow; black should be from burnt grain;
:p 85

